01:16.120 --> 01:17.080
Ada apa?

01:19.039 --> 01:19.800
Arak.

01:19.800 --> 01:20.760
Berikan aku arak.

01:21.200 --> 01:21.960
Arak.

01:26.920 --> 01:27.680
Ayo.

01:42.000 --> 01:43.039
