15:20.520 --> 15:21.440
Oh.

15:22.560 --> 15:23.680
Benarkah?

15:26.640 --> 15:29.520
Jenderal Muda jangan mempersulit hamba.

15:29.520 --> 15:30.600
Sebelum mengirim pasukan,

15:30.600 --> 15:32.000
